  <dashboards>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='DEFINITIONS'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/Storeportfoliomanagement-WIP/Definitions?rev=' id='DEFINITIONS' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/StoreInventoryAssestUtilization-devversion' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='700' maxwidth='1200' minheight='700' minwidth='1200' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='97714' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='1143'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='15'>GOAL OF THE DASHBOARD:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>The objective of the dashboard is to provide a visual representation of the inventory available in Salesforce, along with the utilization of electricity, racks, floor space, freezers, and cold rooms. The dashboard aims to assist in understanding the future investment requirements necessary for improving the stores.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='15'>DEFINITIONS:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Store Inventory:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Installed Capacity:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> The electrical capacity that is installed at a store level, measured in KWH (Kilowatt Hours).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Consumed Capacity:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> The amount of electrical capacity that has been consumed during a selected period.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Not Consumed Capacity:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> The amount of electrical capacity that has not been utilized.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'># of Equipment:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> The number of equipment units present in the store, which can include Coolers, Freezers, Light Racks, and Heavy Racks.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'># of Shelves:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> The number of shelves present for each of the equipment units.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Floor Space GLA:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> The Gross Leased Area of the overall floors in the store, including the mezzanine, ground floor, basement, first floor, and other areas.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Floor Space NSS:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> The Net Selling Space of the overall floors in the store, including the mezzanine, ground floor, basement, first floor, and other areas.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Asset Utilization:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'># of Equipment: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>The total number of racks and shelves present in the store.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'># of Shelves:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> The total number of shelves present for each rack &amp; shelf.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Area Sq cm:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> calculated by multiplying the depth and width of the equipment.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Total Sq cm:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> The total area in square centimeters, calculated by multiplying the area of each equipment unit with the number of equipment units and shelves.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Area Sqm:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>  calculated by multiplying Total Sq cm with 0.0001.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Not Utilized Space:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> The Gross Leased Area - Area Sqm.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='15'>NOTES:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Data for Cold Rooms is currently not available.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Custom data has been injected for Electricity Consumed Capacity for the regions of MENA and America. </run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
